        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "△ADE△ABC $\\frac{A D}{A B}=\\frac{2}{3}$ 为相似比\n$\\frac{S_{\\Delta A D E}}{S_{\\Delta A B C}}=(\\frac{2}{3})^{2}=\\frac{4}{9}$ 设$S_{\\Delta A D E}=4x.S_{\\Delta A B C}=9x$ \n$S_{\\square}\\frac{1}{4}\\sqrt{3}D B C E=9x-4x=5x$ \n$\\frac{S_{\\Delta A D E}}{S_{\\Delta B D E}}=\\frac{4x}{5x}=\\frac{4}{5}$ ",
          "block_bbox": [
            411,
